(117,'Hazina Family Hub',24,'Parenting Guidance and Coaching in Nairobi. We provide one-to-one and parenting coach for families, with routine building and sleep training delivered through clinic appointments. Our practice focuses on workshop, and coaching and classes on parenting skills, sleep and behaviour. Services are offered in English, Kiswahili and Kikuyu.','one-to-one,parenting-coach,parenting-guidance-and-coaching,routine-building,sleep-training','Parklands','Accredited parenting coach, 5 years practice','info@hazinafamilyhub.example.co.ke','verified','2026-08-01 00:00:00'),
(118,'Salama Parenting Centre',24,'Parenting Guidance and Coaching in Nairobi. We provide routine building and one-to-one for families, with positive discipline and sleep training delivered through weekend availability. Our practice focuses on workshop, and coaching and classes on parenting skills, sleep and behaviour. Services are offered in English and Kiswahili.','one-to-one,parenting-guidance-and-coaching,positive-discipline,routine-building,sleep-training','Donholm','Accredited parenting coach, 5 years practice','info@salamaparentingcentre.example.co.ke','pending','2026-02-17 00:00:00'),
(119,'Riziki Family Support Services',24,'Parenting Guidance and Coaching in Nairobi. We provide behaviour guidance and one-to-one for families, with sleep training and first-time parents delivered through group sessions. Our practice focuses on positive discipline, and coaching and classes on parenting skills, sleep and behaviour. Services are offered in English, Kiswahili and Kikuyu.','behaviour-guidance,first-time-parents,one-to-one,parenting-guidance-and-coaching,sleep-training','Runda','Licensed childcare facility, county-registered','info@rizikifamilysupportservices.example.co.ke','verified','2026-02-13 00:00:00'),
(120,'Zawadi Family Hub',24,'Parenting Guidance and Coaching in Nairobi. We provide one-to-one and sleep training for families, with positive discipline and parenting coach delivered through evening appointments. Our practice focuses on first-time parents, and coaching and classes on parenting skills, sleep and behaviour. Services are offered in English, Kiswahili and Kikuyu.','one-to-one,parenting-coach,parenting-guidance-and-coaching,positive-discipline,sleep-training','Gigiri','Accredited parenting coach, 5 years practice','info@zawadifamilyhub.example.co.ke','verified','2026-01-05 00:00:00');
